---
title: Demo
status: backlog
sp: null
---
# Demo
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=in-progress sp=5
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 ---
 title: Demo
-status: backlog
-sp: null
+status: in-progress
+sp: 5
 ---
 # Demo
